    "preamble": "Joby Varghese vs State Of Kerala on 16 January, 2024 Author: P.Somarajan Bench: P.Somarajan In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present The Honourable Mr. Justice P.Somarajan Tuesday, the 16th day of January 2024 / 26th Pousha, 1945 Crl.Rev.Pet No. 734 Of 2021 Cmp 4254/2016 In Cc 1028/2015 Of Judicial First Class Magistrate Court- I, Ettumanoor Revision Petitioners/Petitioners/Accused: 1. Joby Varghese, S/O Varghese, Puthenparambil House, Muttambalam, Kottayam. 2. Saju Jospeh, Sugar N Spice Bakery And Super Market, Viii/734, M.C.Road, Thavalakkuzhy Ettumannoor, Residing At Sky Line Hill View Apartment - Iib, Muttambalam P.O., Kanjikuzhy, Kottayam. 3.P.I.Prakash James, P.I Lawerence & Company, 3,465, A & B, Pwd Road, Nettoor, Maradu, Cochin. 4. P.I.Lawrence & Company, Pwd Road, Maradu, Cochin. 5. M.Arun Kumar (Nominee M/S.A.V.Thomas Company) 17/2, Palladam Road, Othakalmandapam, Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu. 6.A.V.Thomas & Company, W-21/674, Beach Road, Alappuzha. Respondents/Respondents/Complainant: 1. State Of Kerala, Represented By The Public Prosecutor, High Court Of Kerala, Ernakulam - 682031. 2. Food Safety Officer, Ettumanoor Circle, Ettumanoor, Kottayam District - 686631 3. * Director, Food Safety And Standards Authority Of India, Fda Bhavan, Kotla Road, New Delhi- 1100002 (* Suo Moto Impleaded As Addl R3 As Per Order Dated 16/1/2024 In Crl R P 734/2021) This Criminal Revision Petition coming on for orders upon perusing this petition and upon hearing the arguments of M/S.G.Shrikumar (Sr.), R.Sanjith & Sindhu Krishnah C.S, Advocates for the petitioners and of Public Prosecutor for the respondent one, the Court passed the following: P.Somarajan, J. ------------------------------ Crl.R.P.No.734 Of 2021 ------------------------------ Dated this the 16Th day of January, 2024 O R D E R",
